@startuml request_event_creation

title POST /event-requests (type=CREATE): Solicitar Criação de Evento

actor User
boundary "Frontend" as FE
participant "EventRequestController" as Ctrl
participant "RequestEventCreationUseCase" as UC
participant "CreateEventRequestMapper" as Mapper
participant "EventRequest" as ReqEntity
participant "EventSnapshot" as Snapshot
participant "EventChangeItem" as ChangeItem
participant "EventRequestRepositoryPort" as ReqRepo
participant "EventChangeItemRepositoryPort" as ChangeRepo
database "event_requests\nevent_change_items" as DB

User -> FE: preenche formulário de solicitação e confirma
activate FE
FE -> Ctrl: POST /event-requests\n{type: CREATE, title, description, startAt, endAt,\nisAllDay, recurrenceRule, roomId, justification, userId}
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> UC: execute(CreateEventRequest)
activate UC

UC -> Mapper: toDomain(request)
activate Mapper
Mapper -> ReqEntity: EventRequest.createEvent(userId, justification)
activate ReqEntity
note right of ReqEntity: EventRequestValidation.validate()\nid = new UUID\nstatus = PENDING\ntype = CREATE\ncreatedAt = now()
ReqEntity --> Mapper: eventRequest
deactivate ReqEntity
Mapper --> UC: eventRequest
deactivate Mapper

UC -> ReqRepo: save(eventRequest)
activate ReqRepo
ReqRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO event_requests
DB --> ReqRepo: eventRequest
ReqRepo --> UC: saved
deactivate ReqRepo

UC -> Snapshot: EventSnapshot.of(roomId, title, description,\nstartAt, endAt, isAllDay, recurrenceRule)
activate Snapshot
Snapshot --> UC: snapshot
deactivate Snapshot

UC -> ChangeItem: EventChangeItem.create(eventRequestId, snapshot)
activate ChangeItem
note right of ChangeItem: EventChangeItemValidation.validate()\nbefore = null\nafter = snapshot
ChangeItem --> UC: changeItem
deactivate ChangeItem

UC -> ChangeRepo: save(changeItem)
activate ChangeRepo
ChangeRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO event_change_items
DB --> ChangeRepo: changeItem
ChangeRepo --> UC: saved
deactivate ChangeRepo

UC -> Mapper: toResponse(eventRequest)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> UC: CreateEventRequestResponse
deactivate Mapper

UC --> Ctrl: CreateEventRequestResponse
deactivate UC
Ctrl --> FE: 201 Created {CreateEventRequestResponse}
deactivate Ctrl
FE --> User: exibe confirmação da solicitação
deactivate FE

@enduml
